WEBVTT

00:00.320 --> 00:05.720
Your Highness General Zhu has settled us all some clans.

00:05.800 --> 00:11.800
Unwilling to hand over command those who stayed are mostly veterans all fought over ten years ago.

00:11.880 --> 00:16.840
In that defeat at Yong'an back then we feared the Wuzhao.

00:17.120 --> 00:18.520
And ran.

00:19.400 --> 00:24.480
My wife and son all died under Wuzhao hooves.

00:27.040 --> 00:28.440
This time.

00:29.440 --> 00:33.400
We will definitely for Great Xuan hold this city.

00:42.320 --> 00:43.987
Then I'll trouble General Liu.

01:55.040 --> 01:57.200
Liu Nian pays respects to Your Highness.

